Historical C++ archive
----------------------
reference/cpp/NOTICE preserves the old application's dependency and service
notices, including Qt, KDE Frameworks, and optional libmpv. These describe the
archive, not dependencies of the Rust scaffold. The archive's original
metainfo asset is CC0-1.0; see its source notice.

